Well I read a guide before somewhere on the castersrealm site if I remember correctly.  To be thruthful this really isn't a great idea due to our AoE songs being very short.  You basically have to be RIGHT outside meelee range of a medium sized target to hit it with your AoE songs... and to get 4 in there is just pretty much impossible but can be done.  Basically you end up getting the piss beat out of you especially if they're giant sized mobs because you have to be in meelee for our AoE to hit.  Then you're stuck healing yourself with our uber heal song (notice the sarcasm).  You get just about the same experience from charm kiting as quad kiting because of downtime so to me it's really not worth it due to me rarely getting hit during charm kiting sessions.  Though running out of mana always blows.  Was thinking of getting a necro in the zone to pump me for a donation... not sure if works  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  Perhaps a though for the future...<P>I just starting partnering with Artfull and we've been fear kiting everything.  And I must say we've been getting some nice experience.  Perhaps you should try doing this on mobs that you either can't solo... or just aren't worth the time of chant kiting.<P>--------------------<P>Dethnyte Fatekyller<BR>52nd Disciple of the Whistling Fists<BR>Phyrre Storme<BR>46nd Bard of the 4 Twisting Songs
